+ *  - packed decimal goes through softfloat's decimal conversions;
+ *  - FMOVECR returns the constant ROM as a 68881 does, including the
+ *    entries it does not round to nearest;
+ *  - nothing is allocated: no GMP, no MPFR, no malloc per instruction;
+ *  - FADD, FSUB and FMUL take the fast paths of softfloat_fast.h when the
+ *    operands and FPCR allow, with softfloat's result bit for bit.
